te alle persone che sono sotto il suo comando."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Noble Reincarnation: Born Blessed, So I'll Obtain Ultimate Power","overview":"Noa’s past life as a young adult villager was nothing to write home about. But now he’s reborn as the 13th prince of an empire! His stats screen reveal that he’ll grow stronger proportionately to the number of people serving under him. To gain ultimate power, he’ll do whatever it takes to make sure that those who serve him shall serve him for life!"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"皇帝の十三番目の子供という恵まれた地位、生まれつきレベル上限∞、従えた他人の能力を自分の能力にプラスできるチートスキルをもった世界最強の6歳・ノア。転生によって貴族に生まれ変わり、優れた教育と豊富な資源に支えられた環境で自分の才能を開花させていく。だが、華やかな貴族社会の裏側には陰謀や権力争いが渦巻いていた。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/JWSsWKPsPRLh2bYW4dvxGQdHBH.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/JWSsWKPsPRLh2bYW4dvxGQdHBH.png","language":"en","width":800,"height":256},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cfPAT4fz2IKYwlribC3Suiby6Y6.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cfPAT4fz2IKYwlribC3Suiby6Y6.png","language":"en","width":1000,"height":320},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6OCertEiea8BH37KR8ufNPCjMkp.svg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6OCertEiea8BH37KR8ufNPCjMkp.svg","language":"ja","width":608,"height":228}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zaZpbXyvH4M2Y6ICDuMtvVQyHwd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zaZpbXyvH4M2Y6ICDuMtvVQyHwd.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nKm1VW9tqghLfX5NZeQ7Gm2gSs0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nKm1VW9tqghLfX5NZeQ7Gm2gSs0.jpg","language":"en","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p3SiCuiavhbRWY3y8w1nyIoGPmX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p3SiCuiavhbRWY3y8w1nyIoGPmX.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"h